---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Chapter 1: Foundations and Early Growth">
	<main class="space-y-12 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-8 duration-700 mt-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 pb-24">
		<a href="/modules" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">
			<span aria-hidden="true" class="mr-2">←</span> Back to Modules
		</a>

		<div class="space-y-4">
			<span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-950 border border-white/10 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-bold tracking-widest shadow-inner">
				CHAPTER 1
			</span>
			<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
				Foundations and Early Growth
			</h1>
		</div>

		<div class="prose prose-invert prose-slate prose-cyan lg:prose-xl max-w-none">
			<p class="text-xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
				This chapter explains that globalization isn't a straight line, but a repeating wave that rises and falls, introducing the fact that the average civilization only lasts about 275 years. It covers the very beginning of the cycle, showing how a global system kicks off through Phase Mixture (cultures blending) and Gestation (trade foundations settling) to build up early economic speed.
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>
